<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - VDI Media started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - VDI Media started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has started coverage of VDI Media Inc with a rating of buy, a source at the brokerage said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Hollywood, Calif., company opened up 7/8 to 7-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
